            ></div>
          </fieldset>


          <!-- QUESTION 4 -->
          <fieldset
            class="quiz-question"
            data-question
            data-correct="a"
          >
            <legend>
              <span>4</span>

              How are many medical specialists accessed in B.C.?
            </legend>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q4" value="a" />

              <span>
                Through a referral from another healthcare provider
              </span>
            </label>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q4" value="b" />

              <span>By calling 9-1-1</span>
            </label>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q4" value="c" />

              <span>Specialists are not available to newcomers</span>
            </label>

            <div
              class="question-feedback"
              data-question-feedback
            ></div>
          </fieldset>


          <!-- QUESTION 5 -->
          <fieldset
            class="quiz-question"
            data-question
            data-correct="c"
          >
            <legend>
              <span>5</span>

              Which statement about prescription medications is most accurate?
            </legend>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q5" value="a" />

              <span>MSP automatically pays for every prescription</span>
            </label>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q5" value="b" />

              <span>
                Prescription medications are never covered by any public
                program
              </span>
            </label>

            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="q5" value="c" />

              <span>
                Prescription coverage is separate from MSP and programs such
                as PharmaCare may help with costs
              </span>
            </label>

            <div
              class="question-feedback"
              data-question-feedback
            ></div>
          </fieldset>

          <button
            class="primary-button submit-quiz"
            type="submit"
          >
            <span>Check my answers</span>
            <span>✓</span>
          </button>

          <div
            class="quiz-result"
            data-quiz-result
            hidden
          ></div>
        </form>
      </article>


      <!-- =====================================================
           COMPLETION SCREEN
      ====================================================== -->
      <article
        class="lesson completion-screen"
        data-lesson="8"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="celebration">
          <span class="confetti confetti-1">✦</span>
          <span class="confetti confetti-2">●</span>
          <span class="confetti confetti-3">✦</span>
          <span class="confetti confetti-4">●</span>

          <div class="completion-icon">✓</div>
        </div>

        <p class="completion-eyebrow">
          Module complete
        </p>

        <h2>Congratulations!</h2>

        <p class="completion-intro">
          You completed
          <strong>How Healthcare Works in B.C.</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="completion-score-card">
          <div>
            <span class="score-label">Knowledge check</span>
            <strong data-final-score>Passed</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-divider"></div>

          <div>
            <span class="score-label">Module status</span>
            <strong>Complete ✓</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="completion-card">
          <span>🎓</span>

          <div>
            <strong>What you learned</strong>

            <p>
              You now know the basics of MSP, primary care, urgent and emergency
              services, specialists, prescriptions, healthcare costs and
              language support in British Columbia.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>


        <!-- =================================================
             CERTIFICATE GENERATOR
        ================================================== -->
        <div class="certificate-generator">
          <div class="certificate-generator-heading">
            <div class="certificate-heading-icon">🏆</div>

            <div>
              <span class="certificate-eyebrow">
                Optional
              </span>

              <h3>Create your completion certificate</h3>

              <p>
                Enter your name exactly as you would like it to appear.
              </p>
